<!doctype lake><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="fixed" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><p data-lake-id="uc30aff43" id="uc30aff43"><span data-lake-id="uad262187" id="uad262187">DCache 中会碰到的冲突，导致的延迟挺严重的。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u6d2681e0" id="u6d2681e0"><span data-lake-id="u12b3b999" id="u12b3b999">端口和流水结构冲突：</span></p><ol list="ub8fd82f8"><li fid="u394a7598" data-lake-id="u6964b51f" id="u6964b51f"><span data-lake-id="u911dd04b" id="u911dd04b">DataArray 的 bank conflict</span></li><li fid="u394a7598" data-lake-id="uce319621" id="uce319621"><span data-lake-id="ua1c5aba3" id="ua1c5aba3">MainPipe 的 set conflict</span></li><li fid="u394a7598" data-lake-id="u8171b900" id="u8171b900"><span data-lake-id="u35e2dcb1" id="u35e2dcb1">TagArray 的读写端口冲突</span></li><li fid="u394a7598" data-lake-id="ud97663dc" id="ud97663dc"><span data-lake-id="u5a1aaa6e" id="u5a1aaa6e">Meta 的写读冲突</span></li><li fid="u394a7598" data-lake-id="ud64aceb3" id="ud64aceb3"><span data-lake-id="u71db56c9" id="u71db56c9">回填进入 MainPipe 后的 set 冲突</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id="u2ef490bf" id="u2ef490bf"><span data-lake-id="u0da1d775" id="u0da1d775">资源和协议冲突：</span></p><ol list="ua2671659" start="6"><li fid="u2f1ccb25" data-lake-id="u07fec723" id="u07fec723"><span data-lake-id="ucbb93dd3" id="ucbb93dd3">WritebackQueue block</span></li><li fid="u2f1ccb25" data-lake-id="u293efcbd" id="u293efcbd"><span data-lake-id="uf911e8a6" id="uf911e8a6">Probe conflict</span></li><li fid="u2f1ccb25" data-lake-id="u1631048a" id="u1631048a"><span data-lake-id="uef25193f" id="uef25193f">MSHR conflict</span></li><li fid="u2f1ccb25" data-lake-id="uaabd9d93" id="uaabd9d93"><span data-lake-id="uc04000b1" id="uc04000b1">权限 conflict</span></li><li fid="u2f1ccb25" data-lake-id="ub5708d0a" id="ub5708d0a"><span data-lake-id="ude2f3d95" id="ude2f3d95">别名 conflict</span></li><li fid="u2f1ccb25" data-lake-id="udc62b8ae" id="udc62b8ae"><span data-lake-id="u145e73a9" id="u145e73a9">way 占用 conflict</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id="ue28c0f17" id="ue28c0f17"><span data-lake-id="u4758fcdb" id="u4758fcdb">读写端口冲突的本质是没有那么多读写口。SRAM 做成真多口，时序和面积都会变差；冲突太多，性能又会掉。中间的取舍一般是三种做法：真多端口、复制多份、按 bank 拆开。YQH 的 Data 按 way 和 bank 拆开，Tag 用复制体，Meta 用寄存器（Meta就两位，寄存器开销不高）。Data Array用拆分Bank的方式来达成伪多读写端口的目的。</span></p><h1 data-lake-id="xRbX1" id="xRbX1"><span data-lake-id="uc5a7a31f" id="uc5a7a31f">① DataArray bank conflict</span></h1><p data-lake-id="ua5e0ed66" id="ua5e0ed66"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F35409901%2F1793091204651-f658f0c4-b36f-4fcd-897e-edfd4dbcf03a.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u81b29875-f541-4635-936c-5777f3cc8a5%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u5fc6bcb9-8289-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A398%2C%22height%22%3A296%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22%E9%A6%99%E5%B1%B1-%E4%B8%8D%E5%B8%A6wpu%E7%9A%84data%20bank%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F.drawio.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A120178%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A597%2C%22originHeight%22%3A444%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22256SET%2C4WAY%2C8BANK%E7%9A%84DATABANK%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E5%BD%A2%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%22%2C%22x%22%3A159%2C%22y%22%3A0%2C%22width%22%3A393%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%80%89SET%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E%E8%AF%BB%E8%A6%81%E6%8A%8A%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%22%2C%22x%22%3A261%2C%22y%22%3A289%2C%22width%22%3A186%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WAY%E9%83%BD%E8%AF%BB%E5%87%BA%E6%9D%A5%22%2C%22x%22%3A294%2C%22y%22%3A315%2C%22width%22%3A120%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%8D%E5%B8%A6WPU%22%2C%22x%22%3A43%2C%22y%22%3A44%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SET255%22%2C%22x%22%3A13%2C%22y%22%3A384%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OFFSET3%22%2C%22x%